  "description": "We Got The Interest Rate Cut...So What's Next?!",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Thursday! This episode we briefly cover how to manage the big win with Rigetti, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RGTI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> going forward, now up over 41%. Regardless whether the price goes to $25 or $250…you SHOULD walk away with a win. We are not in the business of timing tops…we find optimal  setups, get into a winning position, and hang on as long as possible!</p><p>Also, we discuss interest …</p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
  "truncated_body_text": "Happy Thursday! This episode we briefly cover how to manage the big win with Rigetti, going forward, now up over 41%. Regardless whether the price goes to $25 or $250…you SHOULD walk away with a win. We are not in the business of timing tops…we find optimal setups, get into a winning position, and hang on as long as possible!",
